      "filename": "Vertiginous Streets in Ouro Preto - Minas Gerais - Brazil.jpg",
      "title": "File:Vertiginous Streets in Ouro Preto - Minas Gerais - Brazil.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/Vertiginous_Streets_in_Ouro_Preto_-_Minas_Gerais_-_Brazil.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
